<mj-text padding="0px 12px 10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Abdool Auto Spare Parts is hiring an Outdoor Sales Executive for automotive batteries, lubricants, and spare parts. The role involves field sales, client meetings, product promotion, customer relationship management, and closing deals across dealers, retailers, workshops, fleet accounts, and industrial users. Candidates should have 2-5 years of outdoor sales experience, preferably in the UAE automotive sector, plus strong communication, negotiation, market knowledge, and a valid UAE driving licence.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><a href="https://dubai.dubizzle.com/jobs/sales-business-development/field-sales/2026/4/16/outdoor-sales-executive-2-140---efaf20f7fc444e368d05b4284a74c388/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;"><strong>Register here </strong></a><strong> </strong></p>
