        <mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
          <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Flydubai will launch direct Dubai-Benghazi flights from June 17, becoming the first UAE carrier to operate non-stop services on the route.</p>
